      "finding": "Load and Loading GoldHEN navigate to external GamerHack. The local BIN listener remains only an Advanced BIN listener link.",
      "recommendation": "Either explicitly label external handoff or point the guarded Load to the reviewed local web/index.html with its actual BIN-listener semantics; preserve exact firmware guards and all upstream/native bytes."
    },
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "files": [
        "scripts/host-dashboard-markup.cjs",
        "scripts/host-webhost-markup.cjs"
      ],
      "finding": "Source/requirements prose repeats across12 platform hub/game/file/manager pages; most setup is already collapsed, but manager panels have open paragraphs and ordered guides.",
      "recommendation": "Keep operational button groups and status/control IDs. Move source/license/instructions/long standalone notes to the own-host popup; keep sender connection fields in a compact operational setup disclosure."
    },
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "files": [
        "scripts/build-host-support-pages.cjs",
        "scripts/build-ps4-firmware.cjs"
      ],
      "finding": "Lua/package/Afterglow pages still present guide paragraphs, source sections and runtime/source ZIP downloads in normal flow.",
      "recommendation": "Afterglow: heading + exact firmware + HEN/Start destination only. Lua: short prepared-save prerequisite and real sender/setup actions, with no fabricated browser Run. Packages: native helper Install/Open actions, detailed install paths/limitations in setup. Move all source/ZIP/provenance sections to the footer popup."
    },
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "files": [
        "scripts/templates/host-trainer.html",
        "hosts/tools/esp-flasher/index.html"
      ],
      "finding": "Authored tools contain explanatory intro/footer text and legal links; functional controls are already independently addressed by IDs.",
      "recommendation": "Keep trainer CUSA/update choices, manual acknowledgement, Attach/Resume/Apply, and all dynamic uncertain-write messages; keep flasher file offsets, explicit verified checkbox/confirm and log. Move intro paragraphs, provenance/hash/package metadata and license/footer prose to popup."
    },
    {
      "priority": 3,
      "files": [
        "hosts/runtime/ps5-umtx/index.html",
        "scripts/build-host-runtimes.cjs"
      ],
      "finding": "UMTX authored root has six prose/status paragraphs and source links. Its Start route is local web/index.html and UA-guarded.",
      "recommendation": "Postprocess this exact authored root only: retain runtime-status/runtime-start and firmware feedback, move supported-list/source/legal/ABI prose into popup. Never broadly postprocess runtime/web or runtime/upstream."
    }
